%% RIDENDINE — Startup / request initialisation sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser / caller
    participant MW as src/middleware.ts
    participant SB as Supabase Auth
    participant RT as Route handler
    participant EN as createCentralEngine
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres

    B->>MW: HTTPS request
    Note over MW: nothing in the app runs before this
    MW->>MW: build CSP nonce  (apps/web ONLY — V-02)
    alt apps/web, non-bypassed path
        MW->>DB: GET platform_settings (30s cache, 1.5s timeout)
        Note over MW: maintenance ⇒ redirect /maintenance<br/>lookup fails ⇒ FAIL OPEN
    end
    MW->>SB: auth.getUser()   ← JWT verified server-side, not getSession()
    SB-->>MW: user | null
    alt protected route and no user
        MW-->>B: 307 → login
    end
    MW->>RT: forward + x-nonce + CSP
    RT->>RT: evaluateRateLimit(policy)
    RT->>EN: getAdminEngine()
    EN->>EN: createAdminClient()  ← SERVICE ROLE, bypasses RLS
    EN->>EN: construct ~25 orchestrators and services
    Note over EN: registerProvider(Resend) · registerProvider(Twilio)<br/>both inert unless env keys are present
    RT->>EN: getXActorContext()
    EN->>DB: profile lookup (admin client)
    DB-->>EN: actor | null
    RT->>RT: guardPlatformApi(actor, capability)   [ops only]
    RT->>EN: business call
    EN->>DB: reads / writes
    EN->>EN: audit.log() · events.flush()
    RT-->>B: successResponse | errorResponse
